WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.040
The Holy Grail War is

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.360
a mock war, fought among seven Heroic 
Spirits summoned to win the Grail.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.320
The Holy Grail War is over, right?

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.830
That I...

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.290
Miyu.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.450
I know you have your own circumstances.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.500
Circumstances which likely involve 
a very deep problem.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.980
However, I won't ask you.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.920
If you don't want to tell me, then I won't ask.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.720
Whether I know or not changes nothing.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.090
After all, you're...

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.100
It's likely that Illya and Kuro,
and perhaps Miyu as well,

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.310
all have some kind of relation to these events.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.610
You think those girls are the culprits?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.190
I didn't say that.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:49.270
But I don't have enough information to deny it.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.230
Why would you use someone like that?

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.490
We believe in them.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.700
In their resolve,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.200
and the answer it will lead us to.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.010
<b>Episode 7 
Enforcer</b>

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.650
Young lady...

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.350
From here on, this is the realm of mages.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.660
Take care.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.100
It's finally time.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.060
Illya...

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.210
Yeah. Ruby!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:55.360
Yes, yes!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.610
Let's put some effort into it!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.110
It's here! The long-awaited transformation scene!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.350
This is what magical girls are really about!

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:05.470
I feel like it's been an awfully long time.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:06.950
Oh?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.700
Wait, why is Kuro-san getting one?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.250
She should be able to instantly transform, 
so why go out of her way?

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.880
I understand.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.310
How frightening Kuro-san is!

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:20.050
Whenever she has a chance to show off her 
cuteness, she joins in, regardless of complaints.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.880
That's what this is about.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.880
What a wonderful attitude to have!

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:28.220
Her habit of greedily taking any chance to 
be seen is something I should learn from!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.760
What this is really about is that 
you need to calm down, Nee-san.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.900
Ah, I'm so touched! The standard Illya-san,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.900
the cool and mysterious Miyu-san, 
and the oriental, mischievous Kuro-san!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.390
They look best when all together!

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:44.360
This version should be preserved for eternity!

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:47.860
To be blunt, Nee-san, you're super obnoxious.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.110
Let's go!

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.190
It's so dark and desolate.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.390
A rather bleak setting for an extra stage.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.360
Hey, Kuro, be more wary—

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:16.400
I don't mind.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.930
In fact, a real fight is best faced while relaxed.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:23.530
Though, make sure you focus when it counts.

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.970
Okay.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:29.450
The plan is the same as we reviewed yesterday.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.660
We finish it in one fight with no tricks.

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:35.010
The most effective, logical tactic.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:36.920
In other words,

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.090
beat it with the first strike!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.090
That's fine,

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.340
but a certain someone still isn't here.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.570
It's almost time, though.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.760
She still isn't here.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.770
Let's just leave the tardy one and go ahead.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:55.480
Hmm... I guess we'll have to.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.440
Five seconds to go.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:04.650
Three... Two... One.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.700
She's the same as ever.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.580
Let's begin.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.670
I'll allow you the first move.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:26.190
That's my greatest concession, given that 
you've prepared the location and transport.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.850
My, thank you.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.010
I hope that concession doesn't 
cause you to end up crying.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.470
Into position.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.610
We'll commence our attack the moment we jump.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.900
Our strategy is just to unleash 
our most powerful attacks,

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:45.570
but if the enemy counters, our defense 
will rest on Illya's physical protection.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.570
O-Okay.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:53.100
That aside, Illya, you must try your 
best to avoid taking damage.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.800
Huh? Why?

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.800
The curse of shared pain.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:57.710
Have you forgotten?

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.710
Oh, yeah...

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:04.420
If I'm hurt, Kuro and Bazett-san will get injured.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.520
I dispelled that curse long ago.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.180
Huh?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:12.100
I had a skilled Sister with a 
poor personality exorcise it.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:15.100
The curse wasn't that complicated.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.920
I-It was that easy to exorcise?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:23.560
I thought it was an incredible curse...

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:29.880
<i>But then why has Kuro left the curse alone?</i>

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:34.480
Now, if everyone is ready, let's head out.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.290
Miyu.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:43.640
Sapphire, please.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.570
Yes.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:49.930
Adding imaginary axis to the 
fifth observed variables.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.050
Beginning inversion preparations.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:55.020
Confirmation that complex space exists.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.910
Focal point established.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.190
Forming limited-dimension Mirror Road.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.900
Forming five-meter radius Mirror Road.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.860
Begin partial inversion of Mirror World Circuits.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.030
Let's go!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:20.990
<i>When we jump, it feels like the 
world is sliding out of place.</i>

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:26.270
<i>But I wonder why it feels so long today...</i>

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:41.270
A mist of black mana...

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.960
This is the same as when we fought Saber?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.710
No, this is clearly on another level!

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.120
Don't be led astray!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:57.990
Regardless of the enemy's appearance, 
the action we must take is the same!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.950
The action we must take, huh?

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:02.580
Who's making the first move again?

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.380
I know!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.170
Well, I need to prepare, too.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.020
Illya and Miyu, prepare your charges.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.100
Y-Yeah!

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:15.970
Yes!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.350
<i>I'll open a path first.</i>

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.570
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:26.460
<i>It's both shield and weapon.</i>

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.610
<i>A mist of super-dense mana...</i>

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:36.700
<i>First one.</i>

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:39.910
<i>Two.</i>

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.250
<i>Three.</i>

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:56.050
<i>Four. Now!</i>

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.380
Luvia-san!

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.390
No!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.030
We each have our own roles to fill.

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.850
Rin-san...

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.350
Your turn's coming up soon.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:08.350
Begin charging!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.450
We can't afford to trip up at the start!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:23.250
<i>This is probably only a conditional 
reflex, to counter attacks.</i>

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.000
<i>Yet it still has such strength and precision.</i>

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.450
<i>This is like jumping into the enemy's 
stomach right from the start.</i>

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.670
<i>But this level is only...</i>

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.260
what we expected.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:39.850
<i>Sign!</i>

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.850
<i>Jormungandr!</i>

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:48.920
We've restrained it!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.730
Illya! Miyu! Charge as fast as you can!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:01.260
<i>Vom Ersten sum achten.</i>

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:03.080
<i>Eine Folgeschaltung.</i>

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:08.750
<i>Erste kreis, Neuer gaboren donner, Dref.</i>

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.750
<i>First, spring thunder... whirl.</i>

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:12.210
<i>Zweite, Junger donner, lauf.</i>

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:12.210
<i>Second, violent thunder... race.</i>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.590
<i>Dritte, erwachsener donner, Hupf.</i>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.590
<i>Third, thunderclaps... dance.</i>

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.550
<i>Fourth, roaring thunder, to course.</i>

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:19.400
<i>Folg, Alter donner, Vierte kreis.</i>

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.800
<i>Fifth, a hundred thunderclaps.</i>

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:24.930
<i>Sixth, heavy thunder... surround.</i>

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.460
<i>Seventh, Heaven's thunder... rage.</i>

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.810
<i>Eight, divine thunder...</i>

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.360
<i>Display your providence!</i>

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.560
A battery, huh?

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.290
It's a high-speed amplification circuit for mana.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:46.780
I know we promised not to interfere 
with each other, but I'll warn you.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:49.710
It's best not to step in front of us.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.540
Rin-san!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.580
We're ready!

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.050
Fire away!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:01.340
<i>Thor's Hammer!</i>

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.340
Fire!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:09.790
We did it!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.560
Yeah.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.270
Not yet.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:16.110
Its presence hasn't faded.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:23.200
<i>I don't know the reason, 
but I understand how it's done.</i>

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.470
<i>I don't know why, but I know what to do.</i>

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.040
<i>That is my power.</i>

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.880
<i>Appraise the conceptual production,</i>

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.100
<i>imagine its fundamental essentials,</i>

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.960
<i>replicate its material composition,</i>

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.740
<i>imitate the techniques for its creation,</i>

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.230
<i>sympathize with the experience of its growth,</i>

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:44.720
<i>recreate its accumulated years,</i>

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.220
<i>surpass all of its manufacturing.</i>

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.320
<i>Bind those illusions together here,</i>

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.530
<i>and forge the sword!</i>

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.820
What a fearsome concentration of mana.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:10.840
<i>That arrow... Its rank is unlike any before.</i>

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.360
Illya-san, watch out for the shock wave!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:14.700
Y-Yeah!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:17.210
Finish it off, Kuro!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.300
That's...

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:43.610
A shield?

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.570
Where did it...

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.570
No, more importantly...

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:52.000
It blocked our most powerful attack?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.170
Wh-What do we do? Fire another?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.580
Illya!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.630
Its attacks are getting fiercer!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.790
There's no time to build a charge.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.430
We're retreating for now! Focus on evasion!

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.390
Luvia, your excess wealth is meant 
for times like these, isn't it?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.850
I know.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:19.720
I had no idea I'd end up using these reserves.

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:28.660
It won't hold!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:36.920
It's coming!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.630
What do we do?!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.470
There's no need to think about it!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.950
Retreat!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.220
The strategy has failed!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.090
Return and regroup!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.270
Then...

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.860
It's my turn now.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:07.950
That woman...

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.930
She plans to charge in alone?

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.260
Miyu, take everyone and escape.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.250
It's pointless!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.840
We won't make it in time.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.260
That woman's

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:32.720
going to die.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:46.420
Illya-chan? Kuro-chan?

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.200
Yes...

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.990
I can't deny the need for that.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:03.420
What will happen from now on is unknown.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.130
We should give it some thought.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.820
Yes. Farewell.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.600
Good grief...

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.350
It seems I'm stuck working overtime tonight.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:21.950
For now, shall we get changed?

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:26.440
<i>Where did it...</i>

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.320
<i>How?</i>

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.760
<i>No, that's not what requires consideration.</i>

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.620
<i>These swords piercing my body...</i>

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:41.830
<i>They easily pierced the gloves woven 
with hardening runes! These are...</i>

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:58.680
What's that?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:00.640
What is that?

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:17.470
<i>Swords impaled... in eight places.</i>

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:22.730
<i>Two are fatal... in the abdomen.</i>

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.840
Bazett—

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:31.150
She won't...

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.970
Conditions cleared...

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:59.610
No way! How can she do that 
after her heart was pierced?

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:00.410
Resuscitation.

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.040
Most likely, it activated the 
moment her heart stopped.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:07.500
That's magic on par with a Noble Phantasm.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:13.010
Then she really is a genuine Berserker woman.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:15.220
<i>It's useless.</i>

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.510
<i>No matter how much I damage it, 
it uses that vast mana to repair.</i>

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:21.220
<i>To make it worse,</i>

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.470
<i>it has those!</i>

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:27.980
It's no use.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:32.440
Even if she has power like that of a 
Heroic Spirit, she'll never be a match for it.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.650
What do you mean?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.080
This has to be some kind of joke.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.610
Can't you tell what those are?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.800
<i>Effortlessly manifesting swords, 
spears, and shields...</i>

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:48.040
<i>Every Heroic Spirit has an armament 
symbolizing their legend, a Noble Phantasm.</i>

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:52.000
<i>As a general rule, each only possesses one.</i>

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:56.220
<i>At the very most, three!</i>

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.100
<i>It's foolish trying to count them all...</i>

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:07.940
<i>They're all Noble Phantasms?</i>

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.330
Noble Phantasms?

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:10.900
Every one?

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.440
They're coming!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.330
R-Ruby, physical protection!

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.260
There's no way that'll work.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.070
<i>Rho Aias!</i>

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:29.670
Kuro!

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.040
No! My shield won't hold!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.220
We have to escape!

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:35.890
Hurry!

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:41.970
<i>They've escaped, then? Wise decision.</i>

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.890
<i>Now, for me...</i>

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:48.600
<i>Defeating that thing is the only way out!</i>

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:11.500
<i>I don't need extravagant measures 
to put down a single target!</i>

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.460
<i>One blow!</i>

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.100
<i>Wha?</i>

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.730
Good grief, you're troublesome.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.560
Bazett-san, please!

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:35.860
Why did you return? Too foolish.

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.070
<i>They can't hold it off until its next attack.</i>

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:44.210
<i>Those bonds are no better than a placebo,
but thanks to them, I'll reach it!</i>

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:49.170
<i>Harden, strengthen, accelerate, multiply.</i>

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.290
Simply...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.500
Gouge the Card out!

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.520
I got it!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.510
The eighth Card...

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.440
Its class is...

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.430
Archer?

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.440
Impossible.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.550
No way! Even in that state...

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.590
It can still move?

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:42.010
Holy Grail!

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.480
Illya! Kuro!

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:21.440
D-Did we escape?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.300
It was a very close call...

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:26.200
What was that?

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:28.650
You idiots!

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:31.980
What were you thinking, slipping out 
right before we jumped?!

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:37.000
It seems we can't say you returned safely.

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:38.770
I witnessed hell.

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:39.590
No...

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.560
A myth.

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:48.500
We've learned two things.

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.600
That Heroic Spirit's identity is still 
unknown, but his class is Archer.

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:56.590
A second Archer?

00:22:56.590 --> 00:23:00.500
Also, there's no chance of victory for us.

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.630
We should forget about retrieving that Card, 
and search for a different solution.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:09.480
I concur.

00:23:10.270 --> 00:23:13.870
Frankly, I don't want to fight that again.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.720
But if we just leave it like this...

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.080
Anyway, we'll report to the Mages Association—

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.130
Did you forget to wear your skirt?!

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.420
Are you insulting us?

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.170
We're going after the enemy!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.180
Another Holy Grail War exists.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.800
You need to get your act together.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.630
We have to stop this ceremony!

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Observer</b>

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:35.890
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!
